{"3718040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nocturnal Throne", "steam_appid": 3718040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nocturnal Throne is an <strong>action rogue-lite</strong> where you go through an <strong>endless</strong> series of levels <strong>collecting items</strong>, <strong>upgrading weapons</strong> and <strong>levelling up</strong> your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/a4cfb9c2ea06e134d91b23c3d3f743a4.poster.avif?t=1779846110\" width=570 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/a4cfb9c2ea06e134d91b23c3d3f743a4.webm?t=1779846110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/a4cfb9c2ea06e134d91b23c3d3f743a4.mp4?t=1779846110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENEMIES LEVEL UP WITH YOU</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies <strong>never</strong> stop getting stronger. The <strong>longer</strong> you play, the <strong>harder</strong> they get. Enemies also have <strong>buffs</strong> which can modify them in many different ways: like making them <strong>explode</strong>, or <strong>freeze you</strong>, or <strong>set you on fire</strong>, or even <strong>making them be made of solid gold</strong>. The combinations of enemies are truly <strong>endless</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/931524ba8c05649b49d58acadfc87661.poster.avif?t=1779846110\" width=570 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/931524ba8c05649b49d58acadfc87661.webm?t=1779846110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/931524ba8c05649b49d58acadfc87661.mp4?t=1779846110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE ONLY LIMITS ARE YOUR IMAGINATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect items</strong> that improve your stats. <strong>There are no limits</strong>, collect as many items as you want and become <strong>unbelievably strong</strong>. There are dozens of items to find and discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/68a239d24ac4e100782bb2bfe96da1b5.poster.avif?t=1779846110\" width=570 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/68a239d24ac4e100782bb2bfe96da1b5.webm?t=1779846110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/68a239d24ac4e100782bb2bfe96da1b5.mp4?t=1779846110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PUSHING YOU TO YOUR BREAKING POINT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>challenges</strong> to unlock new <strong>items</strong>, <strong>weapons</strong> and <strong>characters</strong>. There is a plentiful amount of challenges for you to do, <strong>pushing your skills and builds to the limits</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nocturnal Throne is an <strong>action rogue-lite</strong> where you go through an <strong>endless</strong> series of levels <strong>collecting items</strong>, <strong>upgrading weapons</strong> and <strong>levelling up</strong> your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/a4cfb9c2ea06e134d91b23c3d3f743a4.poster.avif?t=1779846110\" width=570 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/a4cfb9c2ea06e134d91b23c3d3f743a4.webm?t=1779846110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/a4cfb9c2ea06e134d91b23c3d3f743a4.mp4?t=1779846110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENEMIES LEVEL UP WITH YOU</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies <strong>never</strong> stop getting stronger. The <strong>longer</strong> you play, the <strong>harder</strong> they get. Enemies also have <strong>buffs</strong> which can modify them in many different ways: like making them <strong>explode</strong>, or <strong>freeze you</strong>, or <strong>set you on fire</strong>, or even <strong>making them be made of solid gold</strong>. The combinations of enemies are truly <strong>endless</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/931524ba8c05649b49d58acadfc87661.poster.avif?t=1779846110\" width=570 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/931524ba8c05649b49d58acadfc87661.webm?t=1779846110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/931524ba8c05649b49d58acadfc87661.mp4?t=1779846110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE ONLY LIMITS ARE YOUR IMAGINATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect items</strong> that improve your stats. <strong>There are no limits</strong>, collect as many items as you want and become <strong>unbelievably strong</strong>. There are dozens of items to find and discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/68a239d24ac4e100782bb2bfe96da1b5.poster.avif?t=1779846110\" width=570 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/68a239d24ac4e100782bb2bfe96da1b5.webm?t=1779846110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/68a239d24ac4e100782bb2bfe96da1b5.mp4?t=1779846110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PUSHING YOU TO YOUR BREAKING POINT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>challenges</strong> to unlock new <strong>items</strong>, <strong>weapons</strong> and <strong>characters</strong>. There is a plentiful amount of challenges for you to do, <strong>pushing your skills and builds to the limits</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Time is difficulty. The longer you play, the harder it gets. Collect 100s of items to secure your build and obliterate anything that crosses your path in Nocturnal Throne. There are no limits in this rogue-lite.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/07f84c6b24f062dd91f6d6c3bf4bf2b94c8e89f4/header.jpg?t=1779846110", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/b42c0715561a5cff5f385ac407cf71aa3394b0b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779846110", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steams